  "Body": {
    "ContentType": "html",
    "Content": "<p>The following updates were made to the Azure portal in January 2019:</p>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-azure-portal-january-2019-update/preview/#Landing%20page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Landing page</a></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-azure-portal-january-2019-update/#New%20Azure%20portal%20home%20page\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">New Azure portal home page</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-azure-portal-january-2019-update/preview/#Dashboard\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Dashboard</a></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-azure-portal-january-2019-update/preview/#The%20shared%20time%20range%20for%20tiles%20on%20dashboards\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Shared time range for tiles on dashboards</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<h4><strong><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-azure-portal-january-2019-update/preview/#Azure%20Container%20Instances\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Azure Container Instances</a></strong></h4>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n\t<li><a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-azure-portal-january-2019-update/preview/#New%20start%20functionality\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">New start functionality</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<p>For more details, see the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://azure.microsoft.com/en-us/blog/microsoft-azure-portal-january-2019-update\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">blog post</a>.</p>\r\n",
    "Markdown": "The following updates were made to the Azure portal in January 2019:\n\nLanding page\n\nNew Azure portal home page\n\nDashboard\n\nShared time range for tiles on dashboards\n\nAzure Container Instances\n\nNew start functionality\n\nFor more details, see the blog post ."
  },
